data/paris-landmarks.tif
========================

Source:  BD ORTHO, via the IGN Géoplateforme WMTS
         https://data.geopf.fr/wmts  (layer ORTHOIMAGERY.ORTHOPHOTOS)
Area:    Paris 7th/8th/16th arrondissements — the Eiffel Tower, the
         Trocadéro and the Arc de Triomphe.
Licence: Licence Ouverte / Open Licence, version 2.0 (Etalab)
         https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/licence-ouverte-open-licence/
         Attribution required.

    © IGN — https://www.ign.fr/

Regenerate with `./scripts/make-paris.sh`, which fetches the tiles and
rebuilds the COG. It is included in this repository as a sample rather than
fetched at build time so the demo has something to show offline, and because a
COG whose tiling this project depends on should not change under it silently.
